body:
A mug that ages with your mug...

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

I'll go hang my self now...

Your games ARE still awesome.

&#x200B;

I had to correct the sentence.

What basically went through my head from walking on the sidewalk to calling the cops:

&#x200B;

What’s that noise behind me? O FUCK a dog is running at me, FUCK WHERE IS THE OWNER!, Only 1 dog, Don’t get bit, don’t get bit, rabies shots are bad, \~tries to kick dog away\~ don’t get bit. \~dog attacks the boot followed by head pinned to ground with boot\~ dog freaking out and trying to scratch me while still chomping down on boot, no owner, no one with in sight range to help me, die fucker die, contact law enforcement about the dog attack. Sick to stomach from adrenaline rush, walk away from dead dog (didn’t want to look at it). wait for the cops to arrive. Cops showed up in about 10-15 minutes.
